        "ok": {
          "content": "Source: https://archive.org/advancedsearch.php?q=mediatype%3Asoftware+AND+povray&fl%5B%5D=identifier&fl%5B%5D=title&fl%5B%5D=date&fl%5B%5D=description&rows=100&sort%5B%5D=date+asc&output=json (application/json, 268953 bytes)\n\n{\"responseHeader\":{\"status\":0,\"QTime\":21,\"params\":{\"query\":\"mediatype:software AND (text:povray OR text:povray OR text__reviews:povray)\",\"qin\":\"mediatype:software AND povray\",\"fields\":\"identifier,title,date,description\",\"wt\":\"json\",\"sort\":\"date asc\",\"rows\":100,\"start\":0}},\"response\":{\"numFound\":40,\"start\":0,\"docs\":[{\"date\":\"1993-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"description\":\"Wireframe CAD Program for Povray Ray Tracing.\",\"identifier\":\"POVCAD1A_ZIP\",\"title\":\"POVCAD 1.0a\"},{\"date\":\"1993-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"description\":\"RayLathe is a text based tool that allows you to create three dimensional objects using the metaphor of the machinist's lathe. Objects can be created for POVRAY 1.0 or Vivid 2.0 ray tracing programs. uLathe (lathe151.zip) is an excellent front end to RayLathe. Author: Ken Koehler\",\"identifier\":\"RAYLAT11_ZIP\",\"title\":\"RayLathe v 1.1\"},{\"date\":\"1993-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"description\":\"PV3D modeler V1.00 for POVRAY 1.0 Graphics interface (GUI) with mouse. Include : 3D animation function 3D visualisation with camera / look_at Vectoriel object structure. POV primitive support, Blob structure Dynamic Rotate Move Scale (R-M-S) Support Groupe and Object Library CSG, Constructive Solide Geometry Direct generation of POV-RAY 1.0 files And more, Spline, Texture .......... Freeware Unregistered Version\",\"identifier\":\"PV3DV1_ZIP\",\"title\":\"PV3D modeler V1.00 for POVRAY 1.0\"},{\"date\":\"1993-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"description\":\"Program to Generate 4D POVRay 1.0 Objects and Scenes.\",\"identifier\":\"SPRING12_ZIP\",\"title\":\"SPRING v 1.2\"},{\"date\":\"1993-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"description\":\"3D CAD program for Povray 2.0\",\"identifier\":\"POVCAD3_ZIP\",\"title\":\"POVCAD v3.0\"},{\"date\":\"1994-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"description\":\"Color bar for Povray: 3-12 color bands.\",\"identifier\":\"CMAPPOV2_ZIP\",\"title\":\"ColorMapper V1.0\"},{\"date\":\"1994-05-01T00:00:00Z\",\"description\":\"Originally posted to alt.binaries.old.nl by MeiMei. /BIN_DOS \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 ARC Version 6.02 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 ARJ 2.41 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 compress,v 4.3 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 LHA version 2.12 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 Pak 2.51 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 PKARC Version 3.6 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 PKZIP/PKUNZIP/PKZIPFIX Version 2.04g \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 PKXARC Version 3.5 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 zoo 2.1 /BIN_OS2 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 ARC Version 5.21 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 FUnZip v2.4 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 LH2 V2.14 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 UNARJ 2.41 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 UnZip 5.0p1 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 zip/zipnote/zipspilt 2.0.1 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 ZipInfo v1.0p1 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 zoo /DCC - DOS-COMMAND-CENTER Version 1.8 /FC - File Commander/2 V1.03 /FILESBBS - Directory listings /ZIPPED \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 /DOS \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 /BBS - DOS BBS software \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 /DIV - Misc. DOS software \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 /NOVELL \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 /1_H - Info, patches and software for DR-DOS and NetWare, 1 - H \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 /I_N - Info, patches and software for DR-DOS and NetWare, I - N \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 /O_Z - Info, patches and software for DR-DOS and NetWare, O - Z \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 /OS2 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 /APP - OS/2 applications \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 /ARC - OS/2 archive software \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 /BBS - OS/2 BBS software \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 /DRV - OS/2 drivers \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 /FIX - OS/2 patches \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 /GAM - OS/2 games \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 /GNU - OS/2 GNU software \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 /INF - OS/2 info \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 /LAN - OS/2 networking software \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 \\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 /SYS - OS/2 system tweak software\",\"identifier\":\"os2mast_594\",\"title\":\"OS/2 Master 5/94\"},{\"date\":\"1995-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"description\":\"Source Printer 2.0 (Windows) prints your code so that it is easy to read. Preserves indented blocks and intelligently word wraps. Specify different fonts for normal and commented code. Specify headers/footers, char/line spacing and more. Supports drag/drop, Clipboard. Interprets comments for a number of languages (Assembler, Basic,C, C++,Cobol, Fortran, Lisp, Pascal, POVRay, Clipper). Specify a user defined comment format to handle almost any other programming language. Source Printer is shareware.\",\"identifier\":\"SRCP20_ZIP\",\"title\":\"Source Printer 2.0\"},{\"date\":\"1995-10-10T00:00:00Z\",\"description\":\"POV-RAY (Gu\\u00eda de Referencia y Ejemplos de Pr\\u00e1ctica, 3 CD + Sobres) * Colecci\\u00f3n de 3 CDs, pero el CD de \\\"Curso Interactivo\\\" no pudo ser copiado por estar partido, s\\u00f3lo se incluye su esceneo. ISO files created with AnyBurn TIFF/JPG files created with Gimp (Epson TX115 Scanner)\",\"identifier\":\"le-povray-ejemplos-guia\",\"title\":\"POV-RAY (Gu\\u00eda de Referencia y Ejemplos de Pr\\u00e1ctica, 3 CD + Sobres)\"},{\"date\":\"1996-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"description\":\"From the Original Readme:\\u00a0 Sced, a constraint based scene editor, or authoring tool if you're into VRML. Sced is a program for creating 3d scenes, then exporting them to a wide variety of rendering programs. Programs supported are: \\u00a0POVray, Rayshade, any VRML browser, anything that reads Pixar's RIB \\u00a0format, and Radiance. Plus a couple of local formats, for me. Sced uses constraints to allow for the accurate placement of objects, and provides a maintenance system for keeping this constraints satisfied as the scene is modified. You only need to get the source distribution.\",\"identifier\":\"sced-0.93\",\"title\":\"sced-0.93\"},{\"date\":\"1996-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"description\":\"Shareware and freeware programs and games that were introduced in the Finnish computer magazine MikroBitti in 1994 and 1995. Copied from the CD-ROM S\\u00e4hk\\u00f6inen lehti . Note: P D F files are not included for copyright reasons.\",\"identifier\":\"mbcd9495\",\"title\":\"MikroBitti '94/'95 - MBnet-ohjelmat\"},{\"date\":\"1996-06-20T00:00:00Z\",\"description\":\"Windows 95/98/ME/XP theme Read Me file: Star Trek VI Plus Theme. Well here it is. Star Trek VI Plus theme for Windows 95. I spent a lot of time getting all the files and making the sounds for this theme, so I hope you enjoy it. I got the background wallpaper from a Persistence of Vision scene. It's writer is Ville Saari and he last updated the file on 10-7-93. His Povray scene can be found on ftp.cdrom.com in the povray directory. All sounds and icons were made by myself. Any comments or questions can be directed to Wade Whitman at wade@wolfenet.com. INSTALLATION: Unzip all files into your \\\\Program Files\\\\Plus!\\\\Themes\\\\ directory or whatever directory you installed the Plus Pack into. You will also need to move the ST6 screensaver.scr into the \\\\Windows\\\\System directory to make it work. That's it, now you're done! Again, I hope you enjoy this theme, all comments and questions can be directed to me at wade@wolfenet.com. ENJOY!\",\"identifier\":\"st6theme\",\"title\":\"Star Trek 6 Movie\"},{\"date\":\"1996-09-01T00:00:00Z\",\"description\":\"CHIP 1996. szeptember (CD 07) (Hungarian PC magazine CD) Frakt\\u00e1l k\\u00e9pt\\u00f6m\\u00f6r\\u00edt\\u00f6 Windowshoz Quake 1.01 demo 300 Mbyte-nyi DOS/Windows shareware Device driverek gy\\u00fclytem\\u00e9nye 1. GNU Free DOS Povray 3.0 DOS/Linux Scene party comp\\u00f3k Internet-b\\u00f6ng\\u00e9sz\\u00f6: Monty Python & Star Wars Spectrum \\u00e9s Amiga emul\\u00e1torok HPFS driverek Dos-hoz RamGate demo\",\"identifier\":\"CHIP1996SzeptemberCD07\",\"title\":\"CHIP 1996. szeptember (CD 07) (Hungarian PC magazine CD)\"},{\"date\":\"1996-11-01T00:00:00Z\",\"description\":\"CHIP 1996. november (CD 09) (Hungarian PC magazine CD) POVRAY 3.0 for Windows POV seg\\u00e9dprogramok \\u00e9s scene-ek Netscape Navigator 3.0 (90 napos pr\\u00f3baverzi\\u00f3k) Internetb\\u00f6ng\\u00e9sz\\u0151: Rocky Horror Picture Show Borland Delphi 2.0 Desktop trial version SAC: 90 Mbyte-nyi DOS/Windows utility J\\u00e1t\\u00e9k: Death rally, Quake 1.06,... Device driverek gy\\u0171lytem\\u\n\n[truncated at 8000 of 268953 chars — raise `max_length` or fetch a more specific page]"
