      "ts": 1786351721819,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Search engines are blocking automated queries. Let me try the archive.org item approach more thoroughly - checking the OS/2 and other collections that contained POV-Ray. Let me also try fetching the file via the Internet Archive's FTP-to-HTTPS proxy and check what older snapshots (pre-redirect) might have the actual content."
    },
    {
      "ts": 1786351721819,
      "type": "tool_start",
      "call": {
        "call_id": "call_c3e62586ba954cc1bb77800f",
        "name": "bash",
        "input": {
          "command": "cd /app\n# Check if there are OLDER snapshots from when the file was actually served (pre-Cloudflare, actual 200)\n# Look for snapshots between 2000-2010 timeframe\necho \"=== CDX all snapshots POVSRC.ZIP (any status) ===\"\ncurl -sL --max-time 40 \"https://web.archive.org/cdx/search/cdx?url=ftp.povray.org/pub/povray/Old-Versions/Official-2.2/POVSRC.ZIP&output=json&limit=50&from=1996&to=2015\" 2>&1 | head -40\n"
        }
      }
    },
