      "text": "Interesting - `README2.2` came through via the `2id_` raw stream but `KNOWNBUGS.DOC` redirected to the Wayback UI. The key insight: `README2.2` worked through the `2id_` stream. Let me try the binary source files directly through this same mechanism with explicit snapshots."
