    {
      "ts": 1786351820239,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Both are modern POV-Ray. Let me try fetching the POV-Ray source directly from the GNU mirrors and other known software archives that mirror old Unix source. Let me also try the SimTel mirror which famously hosted POV-Ray."
    },
    {
      "ts": 1786351820239,
      "type": "tool_start",
      "call": {
        "call_id": "call_7fb443c7f0064fdda3e635ed",
        "name": "bash",
        "input": {
          "command": "cd /app\n# SimTel (Coast) archive mirrors historically hosted POV-Ray. Try the oak/oakland mirrors.\n# Also try ibiblio which hosts many old Unix sources\necho \"=== ibiblio povray ===\"\ncurl -sIL --max-time 15 \"https://www.ibiblio.org/pub/linux/apps/graphics/povray/\" 2>/dev/null | grep -iE \"HTTP/|content-type\" | head -2\necho \"=== Try the Hobbes mirror via archive.org ===\"\n# Check if there's a povray directory\ncurl -sL --max-time 25 \"https://web.archive.org/cdx/search/cdx?url=hobbes.nmsu.edu/*&matchType=prefix&filter=original:.*povsrc.*&limit=10&output=json\" 2>&1 | head -10\n"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "ts": 1786351820752,
      "type": "tool_result",
      "call_id": "call_7fb443c7f0064fdda3e635ed",
      "output": {
        "ok": {
          "content": "=== ibiblio povray ===\nHTTP/1.1 404 Not Found\r\ncontent-type: text/html; charset=utf-8\r\n=== Try the Hobbes mirror via archive.org ===\n[]\n\n[exit code: 0]"
        }
      },
