        "input": {
          "command": "cd /app\n# Re-examine the CDX entries that first showed up. They had timestamps in 2026 (recent crawls)\n# but those were redirects. Let me check if there are snapshots from before 2020 (real files).\necho \"=== CDX: povray.org Old-Versions path, older snapshots ===\"\ncurl -sL --max-time 40 \"https://web.archive.org/cdx/search/cdx?url=ftp.povray.org/pub/povray/Old-Versions/*&matchType=prefix&from=1996&to=2019&limit=60&output=json&collapse=urlkey\" 2>&1 | head -60\n"
