        "name": "bash",
        "input": {
          "command": "cd /app\n# The Old-Versions dir was only crawled recently via FTP proxy. \n# Let me check the broader povray.org crawl for any source archive across all time\necho \"=== CDX: all .Z and .tgz under povray.org, 200 status ===\"\ncurl -sL --max-time 45 \"https://web.archive.org/cdx/search/cdx?url=www.povray.org/*&matchType=prefix&filter=original:.*\\\\.(Z|tgz|tar\\\\.gz|zip)$&filter=statuscode:200&from=1998&to=2019&limit=60&output=json&collapse=urlkey\" 2>&1 | head -70\n"
        }
