    {
      "ts": 1786352361211,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Now I understand the build structure. Let me set up the build directory following the UNIX.DOC instructions. The build needs: source files + unix machine files + config.h (renamed from unixconf.h) + makefile (from unix.mak). Let me set up and try compiling."
    },
    {
      "ts": 1786352361211,
      "type": "tool_start",
      "call": {
        "call_id": "call_48a63f894c2a44c4b183bd96",
        "name": "bash",
        "input": {
          "command": "cd /app/povray-2.2\n# Create build directory per UNIX.DOC instructions\nmkdir -p build\n# Copy source files\ncp SOURCE/*.c SOURCE/*.h build/\n# Copy unix machine files\ncp MACHINE/UNIX/UNIX.C MACHINE/UNIX/UNIX.MAK build/\n# Create config.h from unixconf.h\ncp MACHINE/UNIX/UNIXCONF.H build/config.h\n# Create makefile from unix.mak\ncp MACHINE/UNIX/UNIX.MAK build/makefile\nls build/ | head -50\necho \"=== count ===\"\nls build/*.c | wc -l\nls build/*.h | wc -l"
        }
      }
    },
