          "content": "{\"ok\":{\"content\":\"=== full zip listing ===\\n     3030  1993-09-28 15:11   MACHINE/IBMPC/IBMPC.CAT\\n    11644  1994-01-29 20:58   MACHINE/IBMPC/IBMCONF.H\\n   124332  1994-01-29 19:59   MACHINE/IBMPC/IBM.C\\n        0  1994-02-03 13:51   MACHINE/IBMPC/SYMATEC/\\n       91  1993-02-20 13:59   MACHINE/IBMPC/INTEL/_GET_EBX.OBJ\\n     4810  1994-02-03 02:20   MACHINE/IBMPC/INTEL/IBMPC.DOC\\n     5318  1994-02-03 02:20   MACHINE/IBMPC/INTEL/POVMOD.DOC\\n     5926  1994-01-29 18:02   MACHINE/IBMPC/INTEL/ICB.MAK\\n     9272  1994-02-03 02:20   MACHINE/IBMPC/INTEL/VEMD.386\\n    12951  1994-02-03 02:20   MACHINE/IBMPC/INTEL/Q&A.DOC\\n    24312  1994-02-03 02:20   MACHINE/IBMPC/INTEL/IBMPCEXE.DOC\\n   101619  1994-02-03 02:20   MACHINE/IBMPC/INTEL/POVMOD.EXE\\n     7199  1992-03-24 22:08   MACHINE/IBMPC/TIGA/AI.LIB\\n    12641  1992-03-25 14:\\n[… middle elided during compaction — re-run the tool for the full output …]\\nrsion of POV-Ray may be found there as well.\\r\\n* This program is based on the popular DKB raytracer version 2.12.\\r\\nDBL Language_Version = 2.0;\\r\\n    fprintf (stderr,\\\"POV-Ray rendering %s to %s :\\\\n\\\",Input_File_Name,Output_File_Name);\\r\\n  fprintf (stdout,\\\"\\\\n    MVx.x = set compability to version x.x\\\");\\r\\n    case 'v': /* Max Version */\\r\\n      sscanf (&Option_String[2], DBL_FORMAT_STRING, &Language_Version);\\r\\n    fprintf (stdout,\\\"\\\\nPOV-Ray Options in effect: \\\");\\r\\n    fprintf (stdout, \\\"-k%.3f -mv%.1f -i%s \\\", Clock_Value, Language_Version, \\r\\n  fprintf (stderr,\\\"  Persistence of Vision Raytracer Ver %s%s\\\\n\\\",POV_RAY_VERSION,COMPILER_VER);\\r\\n  fprintf (stderr,\\\"  Copyright 1993 POV-Team\\\\n\\\");\\r\\n  fprintf (stderr,\\\"  POV-Ray is based on DKBTrace 2.12 by David K. Buck & Aaron A. Collins.\\\\n\\\");\\r\\n\\n[exit code: 0]\"}}"
