      "type": "text",
      "text": "The build succeeded — `povray` binary is 308KB. The build only generated warnings, no errors. Now I need to install it. First, the build needs the include files for scenes. Let me set up the standard POV-Ray directory structure with the include files (shapes.inc, colors.inc, textures.inc) that the test scene references."
