        "name": "bash",
        "input": {
          "command": "cd /app/povray-2.2\n# The test scene includes shapes.inc, colors.inc, textures.inc\n# These are NOT in the source archive - they're in POVDOC or POVSCN. \n# Let me check the source for any .inc files\nfind /app/povray-2.2 -name \"*.inc\" 2>/dev/null | head\necho \"=== check what files the scene needs ===\"\ngrep \"#include\" /app/deps/illum1.pov"
